# Build context for apps/web/Dockerfile (context: repo root).
# Secrets never enter an image (Sol A05): inject them at runtime instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets/
# private keys and certificates (Sol A05, 2026-10-09)
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_ecdsa*
**/*.keystore
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
# Large or irrelevant to the web build
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.git
repos/
files/
extracted/
backups/
bhaskar_next/
What_is/
docs/
backend/
workspace/
